WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.920
Moonlight and a dim coal fire.

2
00:00:02.970 --> 00:00:05.180
An open book on a desk.

3
00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:08.580
Words lift off the page, one at a time.

4
00:00:08.630 --> 00:00:09.690
Perhaps.

5
00:00:09.740 --> 00:00:11.010
It may be.

6
00:00:11.060 --> 00:00:12.430
We impute it.

7
00:00:12.480 --> 00:00:17.400
Above the town, a red letter A
seems to blaze across the clouds.

8
00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:20.800
Then the same sky shows
only a streak of light.

9
00:00:20.850 --> 00:00:23.110
Why won't the narrator just tell us?

10
00:00:23.160 --> 00:00:25.370
Why does Hawthorne keep hedging?

11
00:00:25.420 --> 00:00:28.370
In this mission, you'll
open Hawthorne's toolkit,

12
00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:32.000
from archaic speech to
a narrator who says we.

13
00:00:32.050 --> 00:00:35.940
You'll watch a dark forest fill
with a sudden flood of sunshine,

14
00:00:35.990 --> 00:00:38.080
and ask why it happens there.

15
00:00:38.130 --> 00:00:41.540
And you'll catch the narrator
hedging again and again,

16
00:00:41.590 --> 00:00:43.540
and ask what he is up to.

17
00:00:43.590 --> 00:00:48.020
Your mission: work out why
Hawthorne keeps saying perhaps.
